Subject: [PATCH 6/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../{Slab.Inline+Operations.swift => __Slab.swift}                | 0
 .../Slab Primitive/{Slab+Sequence.Drain.swift => __Slab.swift}    | 0
 Sources/Slab/{Slab Copyable.swift => __Slab.swift}                | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Slab Inline Primitive/{Slab.Inline+Operations.swift => __Slab.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Slab Primitive/{Slab+Sequence.Drain.swift => __Slab.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Slab/{Slab Copyable.swift => __Slab.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Slab Inline Primitive/Slab.Inline+Operations.swift b/Sources/Slab Inline Primitive/__Slab.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Slab Inline Primitive/Slab.Inline+Operations.swift
rename to Sources/Slab Inline Primitive/__Slab.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Slab Primitive/Slab+Sequence.Drain.swift b/Sources/Slab Primitive/__Slab.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Slab Primitive/Slab+Sequence.Drain.swift
rename to Sources/Slab Primitive/__Slab.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Slab/Slab Copyable.swift b/Sources/Slab/__Slab.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Slab/Slab Copyable.swift
rename to Sources/Slab/__Slab.swift
